{"id":"itakura_dtw","title":"DTW with slope constraints","family":"elastic","definition":"reference","intro_en":"An Itakura-style parallelogram limits how strongly an alignment can stretch near either endpoint. This equal-length illustration uses slopes one half and two, anchored at the first and last samples. Dynamic programming then finds the least-cost path inside that explicitly shown region.","intro_zh":"Itakura 型平行四边形限制对齐路径在两端附近的伸缩程度。本例长度相等，允许斜率范围为二分之一至二，并同时锚定首尾观测。动态规划在图示允许区域内寻找最低代价路径。","steps_en":["Choose raw observations and any neighborhood descriptor.","Compute local squared discrepancies; apply the indicated weights or admissibility mask.","At each admissible cell, add its local cost to the smallest predecessor cost.","Trace one minimizing path and take the square root of its accumulated objective."],"steps_zh":["选择原始观测以及需要的邻域描述符。","计算局部平方误差，并施加指定权重或允许匹配的掩码。","在每个允许单元格，把局部代价加到三个前驱的最小累计代价上。","回溯一条最小化目标的路径，并对其累计目标值取平方根。"],"formula":"Allowed: i/2 <= j <= 2i and (n-1-i)/2 <= n-1-j <= 2(n-1-i)","caveats_en":["Mask discretization and unequal-length slope conventions differ across libraries; this card specifies an equal-length integer-grid example.","Signal scale, path constraints and final normalization must match before distances from different tools are compared."],"caveats_zh":["不同库的离散掩码和异长斜率约定可能不同；本卡明确采用等长整数网格示例。","比较不同工具的数值之前，须统一信号尺度、路径约束和最终归一化。"],"sources":[{"label":"tslearn: DTW definitions and path constraints","url":"https://tslearn.readthedocs.io/en/stable/user_guide/dtw.html"},{"label":"EchoTime imported atlas: named formula conventions","url":"https://github.com/ZipengWu365/EchoTime/blob/main/src/echotime/data/ts_similarity_package_v2_registry.csv"}],"x":[0.2,0.4,1.1,2.4,3.2,2.5,1.2,0.3,-0.4,-0.1],"y":[0.1,0.3,0.5,1.2,2.6,3.1,2.3,1.1,0.2,-0.3],"input_label":"Deterministic illustrative arrays; no benchmark data","parameters":{"local_cost":"squared Euclidean","final_square_root":true,"normalization":"none","itakura":true},"result":{"label":"distance",